  "articleBody": "A successful kitchen renovation starts with a defined scope, a realistic budget, and a qualified remodeling partner who can coordinate design, construction, material choices, and required approvals. Before signing, compare detailed proposals, confirm who handles permits, and make sure the plan addresses layout, storage, utilities, finishes, and how your household will use the room.",
